DESCRIPTION:vent by 360Aurora and Magic Hunks\n360 E. 14th St\, Elmira Hei
 ghts\, NY\nPublic\nTuesday\, November 17th at 7PM\nELMIRA HEIGHTS\, ARE YO
 U READY?!\nAUSTRALIA’S GIRLS NIGHT OUT LIVE® “WILD NIGHTS 2026” WOR
 LD TOUR is hitting 360 AURORA for ONE NIGHT ONLY!\nPrepare for an absolute
  surge of high-voltage Aussie charm\, jaw-dropping choreography\, and hear
 t-pounding energy.\nWhether it's a Birthday\, Bachelorette\, Divorce\, Dir
 ty Thirty\, or just a much-needed night out with your squad—this is the 
 #1 destination to let loose\, misbehave\, and treat yourself to the ultima
 te ladies' night!\nUpgrade Your Night\nWant the ultimate experience? Upgra
 de to a Hunks VIP Experience package or secure the best seats in the house
  with Ultimate Front Row Seating! Check out the ticket tiers at checkout f
 or full details and inclusions.\nShow Schedule:\n7:00 PM: VIP & Front Row 
 Entry\n7:30 PM: Doors Open (General Admission)\n8:00 PM: Showtime!\n10:30 
 PM: Show Ends + Exclusive VIP Meet & Greet\nImportant Reminders:\nArrive E
 arly: Please arrive 30 minutes before your door time to check in and beat 
 the lines.\nEffects Notice: The show features high-intensity strobe and fl
 ashing light effects.\nLineup Disclaimer: MAGIC HUNKS® reserves the right
  to adjust the performer roster based on availability.\nRefund Policy: All
  ticket sales are non-refundable unless the show is canceled. If reschedul
 ed\, previously purchased tickets will be honored for the new date and tic
 ket holders will be notified via email.\n360 E. 14th Street\, Elmira Heigh
 ts\, NY 14903 | 607.333.4764\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.tim
 e.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78504931/20261117190000
GEO:42.130257;-76.817629
LOCATION:360Aurora\, 360 East 14th Street\, Elmira Heights\, New York\, 14
 903\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78504931/20261117190000
