DTEND:20261120T045959Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T175952Z
UID:ae877ef676120f1c3d280a721388ec11584fee7a@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Seniors,Community,Connection
DESCRIPTION:Speaker Garret Callahan\, Manager\, Wegmans\nFor over 30 years
 \, Wegmans has been the main grocery store chain in our area. Listen to Mr
 . Callahan share his perspective on managing a large grocery store and bri
 ng your questions and suggestions to enhance your shopping experience. Thi
 s free informative program for older adults is part of the fall monthly se
 ries. Snacks are provided in a friendly "get to know your neighbors" atmos
 phere.\nLocation:\nFirst Congregational UCC Church\n171 West Pulteney Stre
 et\nCorning\, NY 14830\n(Corner of 171 W. Pulteney St. and Prichard Ave.)
 \nWebsite: https://www.corningareaaginginplace.org/\n\nSource: FLXcalendar
  - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78515462/20261119100000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78515462/20261119100000
