SUMMARY:America the Beautiful: Digital Dome Show
DTSTART:20261124T220000Z
DTEND:20261124T224500Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T175952Z
UID:70592dcaf93cbda885116f3a47f14c7c5829f504@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film,History & Heritage
DESCRIPTION:Event by Corning Community College\n1 Academic Dr\, Corning\, 
 NY\nPublic\nThe Digital Dome Theater will be doing a 2-week run of the awe
 -inspiring 360-degree showing of America the Beautiful\, narrated by Emmy
 ® Award-winning actor Kelsey Grammer.\nThis event is FREE to veterans! Ti
 ckets for general admission to this special show will be $10 per person.\n
 Show Information:\nAmerica the Beautiful is a sweeping giant screen experi
 ence celebrating the vast and varied natural worlds that define the United
  States and the conservation movement that has ensured their survival. The
  protection of America’s beauty\, wonder and resources was set in motion
  by Theodore Roosevelt and other pioneers who popularized principles still
  in practice today\, passed down through generations\, that will keep Amer
 ica’s wild heart beating for many more.\nAudiences will embark on an awe
 -inspiring journey from sea to shining sea\, across the country’s most i
 conic and diverse environments - soaring mountain ranges\, expansive plain
 s\, surprising deserts\, flowing rivers and wetlands - captured with the s
 cale\, clarity\, and immersion of spectacular giant screen cinematography.
  More than a visual spectacle\, America the Beautiful reveals that these p
 laces were not preserved by chance\, but through bold vision\, determinati
 on\, and an enduring commitment to conservation that continues to shape th
 e nation’s natural legacy.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.tim
 e.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78517833/20261120170000
GEO:42.145847;-77.056564
LOCATION:Corning Community College\, Academic Dr\, Corning\, New York\, Co
 rning\, New York\, 14830\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78517833/20261120170000
END:VEVENT
